        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Warrior Girl 2</strong> is a comical JRPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiora, the 16-year-old heroine of the first game, has now grown into a 20-year-old warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four years after defeating the orcs, an even stronger invasion begins.<br>The rural villages on the outskirts of the kingdom are being devastated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has mobilized every possible means to repel the orcs, but ultimately fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearing that the orc raids have begun again, Fiora sets out on a long journey and makes her way to the royal palace…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fiora embarks on a reckless adventure into the orcs’ lair, filled with more powerful enemies and dangerous traps than ever before.<br>Will she be able to defeat the orcs and protect the villagers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>very simple, classic JRPG</strong>.<br>Traps lurk everywhere to threaten Fiora, so you must carefully talk to people and investigate your surroundings to track down the orcs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: Arrow Keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk: Spacebar</p></li></ul>",
